  "type": "multipleCorrect",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Two coherent monochromatic point sources <math><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> of wavelength <math><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>600</mn><mi>n</mi><mi>m</mi></math> are placed symmetrically on either side of the center of the circle as shown. The sources are separated by a distance <math><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.8</mn><mi> </mi><mi>m</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>.</mo></math> This arrangement produces interference fringes visible as alternate bright and dark spots on the circumference of the circle. The angular separation between two consecutive bright spots is <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>θ</mi></math> . Which of the following options is/are correct?<br/><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/ccatdytajcpzbtvqxgmfxzrtpkenvlonhntmlqacpkyksifkai.jpeg\"/></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "jZibr",
      "text": "A dark spot will be formed at the point  <math><msub><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "oTv7V",
      "text": "The angular separation between two consecutive bright spots decreases as we move from  <math><msub><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math>  to  <math><msub><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>  along the first quadrant",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "UlKRn",
      "text": "At <math><msub><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> the order of the fringe will be maximum",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "RwB2k",
      "text": "The total number of fringes produced between <math><msub><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> in the first quadrant is close to 3000",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>At point <math><msub><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>;</mo></math></p><p><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.8</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3000</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#955;</mi></math></p><p>Hence a (bright fringe) will be formed at&nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math></p><p>Now &nbsp; <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>&#955;</mi></math></p><p><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi></math>&nbsp;is with the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>d</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></math>&nbsp;increases as&nbsp;<math><mi>&#952;</mi></math>&nbsp;decreases</p><p>At&nbsp;&nbsp; <math><msub><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp; the order of fringe will be maximum.</p><p>For total no. of bright fringes&nbsp;<math><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3000</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;&nbsp; total no. of fringes&nbsp;<math><mo>=</mo><mn>3000</mn></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
